+\[
+ c_n(R)\downarrow\left(\frac{\pi-\varphi}{\varphi}\right)^2,
+ \qquad \varphi=\arccos\frac{\sqrt R-1}{\sqrt R+1}.
+\]
+这是候选序列的解析定理, 不证明其等于全局上确界 $\Lambda_n^{\sup}(R)$.
